    "body": "Phase B of #654 (builds on phase A pin/matrix #677/PR #678). Concrete server-code slice: (1) the standard OpenAI error envelope {error:{message,type,param,code}} + HTTP status mapping, replacing the ad-hoc {\"error\":\"...\"} bodies on the /v1 compatibility routes; (2) GET /v1/models required fields (id, object, created, owned_by) advertising only loadable models; (3) GET /v1/models/{model} agreeing with the list, 404 envelope on unknown; (4) unsupported/unknown chat params fail closed by name (deny_unknown_fields) with the envelope, never silently ignored. No streaming/responses/usage-accounting yet (phases C-E). Refs #654.",
